
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
ASPScriptDefaultNamespace          	N/A                 	N/A       
ASPScriptEnabled                   	N/A                 	N/A       
AutoStartWin9X                     	N/A                 	N/A       
AutorecoverMofs                    	N/A                 	N/A       
BackupInterval                     	N/A                 	N/A       
BackupLastTime                     	N/A                 	N/A       
BuildVersion                       	N/A                 	N/A       
DatabaseDirectory                  	N/A                 	N/A       
DatabaseMaxSize                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
EnableAnonWin9xConnections         	N/A                 	N/A       
EnableEvents                       	N/A                 	N/A       
EnableStartupHeapPreallocation     	N/A                 	N/A       
HighThresholdOnClientObjects       	N/A                 	N/A       
HighThresholdOnEvents              	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallationDirectory              	N/A                 	N/A       
LastStartupHeapPreallocation       	N/A                 	N/A       
LoggingDirectory                   	N/A                 	N/A       
LoggingLevel                       	N/A                 	N/A       
LowThresholdOnClientObjects        	N/A                 	N/A       
LowThresholdOnEvents               	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxLogFileSize                     	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxWaitOnClientObjects             	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxWaitOnEvents                    	N/A                 	N/A       
MofSelfInstallDirectory            	N/A                 	N/A       
SettingID                          	N/A                 	N/A       

